Made two, with you as Sam.
Send this link to the people you want in it. It works for a day, while this computer is on:

  svrngs://join/<the token>

or, to open it in a browser:

  http://localhost:50196/#<the token>

On a phone, each app opens at an address of its own under localhost:50196, which can see which app is opened.

two's folder is /tmp/two-run/sam/svrngs/two: what anyone in two puts there reaches this computer, and what you put there reaches theirs.

Leave this running; Ctrl-C stops it.
